    "100199.title" : [
      {
        "target" : "यदि आप रीस्टार्ट करते हैं, तो आपकी फ़ाइलें डिलीट कर दी जाएँगी।",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ak reštartujete počítač, budú vaše súbory vymazané.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "sk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "재시동하면 사용자의 파일이 삭제됩니다.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ko"
      },
      {
        "target" : "若你重新開機，你的檔案將會被刪除。",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_TW"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Dacă reporniți computerul, fișierele dvs. vor fi șterse.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ro"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Si reinicias la computadora, tus archivos se eliminarán.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "es_419"
      },
      {
        "target" : "再起動すると、ファイルが削除されます。",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ja"
      },
      {
        "target" : "إذا قمت بإعادة التشغيل، فسيتم حذف الملفات.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Jika Anda mulai ulang, file Anda akan dihapus.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "id"
      },
      {
        "target" : "如果你重新启动，你的文件将被删除。",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Если Вы перезагрузите компьютер, Ваши файлы будут удалены.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ru"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Hvis du starter maskinen på nytt, blir filene dine slettet.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "no"
      },
      {
        "target" : "If you restart, your files will be deleted.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "en_GB"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Se riavvii il computer, i file saranno eliminati.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "target" : "ถ้าคุณเริ่มการทำงานเครื่องใหม่ ไฟล์ของคุณจะถูกลบออก",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Jika anda mula semula, fail anda akan dipadamkan.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "ms"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Om du startar om blir dina filer raderade.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "sv"
      },
      {
        "target" : "如你重新開機，你的檔案將會被刪除。",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_HK"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Als je de computer opnieuw opstart, worden je\nbestanden verwijderd.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "nl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Nếu bạn khởi động lại, các tệp của bạn sẽ bị xóa.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "vi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Si vous redémarrez, vos fichiers seront supprimés.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "fr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "If you restart, your files will be deleted.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Se você reiniciar, seus arquivos serão apagados.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_BR"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Jos käynnistät uudelleen, tiedostosi poistetaan.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "fi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ha újraindítja a számítógépet, a rendszer törli a fájljait.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "hu"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ponowne uruchomienie komputera spowoduje usunięcie plików.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Si vous redémarrez, vos fichiers seront supprimés.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "fr_CA"
      },
      {
        "target" : "אם תפעיל\/י את המחשב מחדש, הקבצים שלך ימחקו.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "he"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ako ponovno uključite računalo, vaše datoteke će se obrisati.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "hr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Pokud počítač restartujete, soubory budou smazány.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Yeniden başlarsanız dosyalarınız silinecektir.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "tr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Se reiniciar, os seus ficheiros serão apagados.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Wenn du neu startest, werden deine Dateien gelöscht.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Якщо перезапустити компʼютер, файли буде видалено.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Αν κάνετε επανεκκίνηση, τα αρχεία σας θα διαγραφούν.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "el"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Hvis du starter igen, slettes dine arkiver.",
        "filename" : "GuestRestart.loctable",
        "language" : "da"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Si reinicies l’ordinador, els teus arxius s’eliminaran.",
